3" end="0:21.093" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:18.863" end="0:18.993">I</span> <span begin="0:18.993" end="0:19.183">don't</span> <span begin="0:19.183" end="0:19.373">wan</span><span begin="0:19.373" end="0:19.443">na</span> <span begin="0:19.443" end="0:19.753">say</span> <span begin="0:19.753" end="0:20.473">bye,</span> <span begin="0:20.773" end="0:21.093">no</span></p><p begin="0:21.579" end="0:24.329" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:21.579" end="0:21.659">I</span> <span begin="0:21.659" end="0:21.999">feel</span> <span begin="0:21.999" end="0:22.119">it</span> <span begin="0:22.119" end="0:22.229">in</span> <span begin="0:22.229" end="0:22.339">my</span> <span begin="0:22.339" end="0:22.969">head,</span> <span begin="0:22.969" end="0:23.309">feel</span> <span begin="0:23.309" end="0:23.409">it</span> <span begin="0:23.409" end="0:23.529">in</span> <span begin="0:23.529" end="0:23.689">my</span> <span begin="0:23.689" end="0:24.329">heart</span></p><p begin="0:24.325" end="0:31.905" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:24.325" end="0:24.615">Feel</span> <span begin="0:24.615" end="0:24.735">it</span> <span begin="0:24.735" end="0:24.835">in</span> <span begin="0:24.835" end="0:24.985">my</span> <span begin="0:24.985" end="0:26.025">body,</span> <span begin="0:26.595" end="0:26.865">but</span> <span begin="0:26.865" end="0:26.935">I</span> <span begin="0:26.935" end="0:27.255">can't</span> <span begin="0:27.255" end="0:27.605">say</span> <span begin="0:27.605" end="0:29.095">no,</span> <span begin="0:29.095" end="0:29.365">no</span> <span begin="0:29.365" end="0:29.525">I</span> <span begin="0:29.525" end="0:29.885">can't</span> <span begin="0:29.885" end="0:30.195">say</span> <span begin="0:30.195" end="0:31.905">no</span></p><p begin="0:31.989" end="0:34.779" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:31.989" end="0:32.119">You're</span> <span begin="0:32.119" end="0:32.489">playin'</span> <span begin="0:32.489" end